#: scenario7:scenario7_BACD08A1_9263_4A2D_8B26_1FF261B8F58D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 583dfcb69c4c8113c88d1406efba79de32b57a8c6f33ed913c0e8dd7f083b06b
#. default-sha256: e0de4e4cb11e33854053f1905c916248c12d30cf65498e062ba0fb5638db69ad
