msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Michelle! Ohh Mich⟪k:8⟫eeee⟪k:9⟫eeeelle! Are you in there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫얘, ⟪k:8⟫미셸~! ⟪k:9⟫미셸 좀~, ⟪k:10⟫있어~?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FB32878E_3B65_40D1_962A_0B9F5ADBCA69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5efdf7873e938f20ac37a77a9a956dfa6e83d97e3005efd19c110c9dac078fd
#. default-sha256: 804d308b5223aeadf84fdcc8f60b5a701848f8d030804fd573eaba522045cfeb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FB32878E_3B65_40D1_962A_0B9F5ADBCA69"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Did you need something, Georges?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫조르주 형님. ⟪k:3⟫무슨 ⟪k:4⟫용건이 있으십니까?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A55F8FEF_1AB7_4FE2_986A_3FBBE54321B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e3a63ca2afdeaf8930494931a2579e607c8c256b6d3927a815f2009a753d9f9
#. default-sha256: e84a1ac2d1283b74da9395b9462275666283236b66b739f94dd82d1f668be7ab
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A55F8FEF_1AB7_4FE2_986A_3FBBE54321B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, c’mon, don’t be like that.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Do I have to “need something” to talk to you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫에이, 쌀쌀맞은 소리 말자.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫용건이 없을 때도 ⟪k:4⟫말 걸어도 되잖아?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3ED6DA89_DABD_4E8E_A636_8C03D240695F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b3fd885b66d48fe76cb4ce020c5c36fa1476979b0959548abedb15cd366a059c
#. default-sha256: ca6aa045c8cba45ef95ac5358084f7d381b4f21708fd5dbb1941dd516d40f682
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3ED6DA89_DABD_4E8E_A636_8C03D240695F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫N-⟪k:2⟫No, but you looked like you were in an unusually good mood,⟪k:3⟫so I thought..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그, ⟪k:2⟫그렇긴 한데요. ⟪k:3⟫신이 나 보이시길래, ⟪k:4⟫무슨 일인가 싶어서……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CF12D587_2FF9_4EE4_991C_31AAEB65C73E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dc1de5640237f509b1a1f7b9f5ca50f6959e2a9f43bcb4d7513203058b230bc7
#. default-sha256: 93a0c1a4f5ef7b6aa356eb6f8596528783a672762ff9acff1ec08544b55431db
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CF12D587_2FF9_4EE4_991C_31AAEB65C73E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, why wouldn’t I be?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s a wonderfully gloomy day out!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그게 그, ⟪k:2⟫오늘이 딱 좋게 흐리잖아!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B074DBC1_FA01_4CC8_954A_6C085E79F2EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b98058e63396fb4fc37d2e9e4fb4783d7202520045368a3ca9398f74dd2e9d3
