msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2F81EBB3_F8A2_41F0_93EE_05BA4326A48B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c7850302f5b2bf5f837a079d546904e9d401bd568f725e30b4314ac94b2e779
#. default-sha256: bf11ecd7986df78bf765dbd1ebe14c55d902207cdb24ba9b4eeb9f0208bf0fd8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2F81EBB3_F8A2_41F0_93EE_05BA4326A48B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would understand if it were clear out...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫but can you really say it’s "
"“wonderfully” gloomy?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫저기, ⟪k:2⟫맑은 날이면 모를까, ⟪k:3⟫흐린 날에 좋단 말이 맞습니까……?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DFA0EF82_350D_475B_8014_D38E3E4E9C6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 896bae594002bc3ba9b2105e02a7c6a3e8be567772a0d6823480c494b425a0fd
#. default-sha256: d84b79deb6e2bab2700a5e50821d2109d009ba1e62767d43cf266d3dcb57ad7c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DFA0EF82_350D_475B_8014_D38E3E4E9C6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well, you can’t be outside for very long when it’s not cloudy, so in our case, this is "
"perfect weather."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫맑은 날이면 ⟪k:2⟫미셸이 오래 외출을 못 하잖아.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫우리한텐 좋은 날씨지."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E1821575_CA6E_403F_8D30_4330B21534A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42fc39484abeebc11f8d8d787e95e4d14ba1490f9874f5d5c24b6e1e4b0e8b06
