msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E1821575_CA6E_403F_8D30_4330B21534A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C01E4773_3075_4DCE_B133_8C7266956346
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd797aa6f99b858616a9563453f565505d8bdb61f4365e8eb5f891b8de5cc0d4
#. default-sha256: b30f7c1ad9999d73510302a013c01b529b4450099511fc875f984bf6b0c82fab
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C01E4773_3075_4DCE_B133_8C7266956346"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What do you say we go for a little stroll, while we can?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dee’s around today "
"too, so we can see if he’s up for it.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’ll be like old times."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그러니까 산책 나가자. ⟪k:2⟫오늘은 형도 집에 있으니 ⟪k:3⟫같이 가자고 하는 거지. ⟪k:4⟫예전"
"엔 곧잘 ⟪k:5⟫셋이서 외출했잖아?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9406F46A_7FED_421F_A304_80D3F5789C3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db1e86553966ce9b2da17c8a81747f139e3c1e26004e3f1103ca6fcda69765d3
#. default-sha256: c3e433aed182757a3ba067611064a764fb82e4eefa0d1cf88020bce44f867d41
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9406F46A_7FED_421F_A304_80D3F5789C3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫We’ve been running around like headless chickens lately,⟪k:2⟫so we haven’t had much of "
"a chance for a sibling outing.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We’ll have Mom make us a lunch, and then—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫요즘은 ⟪k:2⟫나랑 형이 바쁘다 보니 ⟪k:3⟫못 그랬는데, ⟪k:4⟫예전처럼 어머니한테 도시락 싸 "
"달라 해서――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2086E62F_87B2_47C7_B186_8D57CAE02078
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af4cdff9dbedb06b7bfc8cf62646b342e259b0dd3ae4e8e18f94901d5b3d6a8e
#. default-sha256: 3f9b6e0906941087d2025dd82febab51dbb8c60de13cff76b33d3f00b8f474ee
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2086E62F_87B2_47C7_B186_8D57CAE02078"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ooh, we’ll take a couple horses up to the forest’s edge!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫말을 타고 ⟪k:2⟫숲까지 가 보자!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AB202D56_42D8_44B8_855B_BA820064EA7D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c65f87266806ea348a7774e57fab006b4d70a16577db0143c4be6a03417ce91
#. default-sha256: fee0c610989769a9620406659ad0174193c781aa289a4fc2520e5213f9b8867a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AB202D56_42D8_44B8_855B_BA820064EA7D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I-⟪k:2⟫I’m fine with that if you are."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……네, ⟪k:2⟫네. ⟪k:3⟫형님들께서 ⟪k:4⟫괜찮으시다면요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1CC04FBE_D7D3_499E_8D23_9241BEE32370
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3af27b104bac868d300ad962661418e8f891ccd9829e98fd19e9cc36bdc8f66b
#. default-sha256: 3e10b7acb06e3e0ff13712e9e057fc6d068c8cc4ea4dfc42b0019bb9553f0a02
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1CC04FBE_D7D3_499E_8D23_9241BEE32370"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You bet your bum I am. I asked, after all!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now c’mon, let’s go!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫당연히 ⟪k:2⟫괜찮지.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫자 자, ⟪k:5⟫얼른 가자!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_34D266ED_1135_4E45_9C31_EA6D46852228
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4094c3f19ea2608054af7d48aff3a02c1b7fe7527d9a130b9d3770ff50ec9795
#. default-sha256: 39e3454a59667243e7ca373da61c380365df4d8470baaf05f327b4d7219833e1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_34D266ED_1135_4E45_9C31_EA6D46852228"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫An outing, you say?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫뭐? ⟪k:8⟫산책?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_54C4A907_7278_42D2_914B_8485A57F286B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce26a39f1a7b39d8193f95d06909a47bbcdee0270d3e25bb8a50cd1191dace5d
#. default-sha256: 9bac628b68199f92985f9e4638a136b78da070802a53c8770804d77177d02ec8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_54C4A907_7278_42D2_914B_8485A57F286B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Yepyep. Hop on a couple horses and head for the forest.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We haven’t done "
"this in a while, so I figured why not."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫맞어 맞어, ⟪k:3⟫숲까지 ⟪k:4⟫말 타고 가는 거지.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫오랜만에 셋이서 외출해 보"
"자."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C7FE1404_21B8_4AFB_ACBC_CE0D1EBB2D6E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7821bcb35ead99734aef28260180d1069329e81ad9b2e560a2ad0ed0f96bc2de
#. default-sha256: 01ba941606bbf8f0297ceb666dbcdced88f5d5294d7160994dbd881912c8d2df
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C7FE1404_21B8_4AFB_ACBC_CE0D1EBB2D6E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I see. Well, if Michelle is coming, I see no reason to say no.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Let’s set off "
"right away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래, ⟪k:2⟫미셸도 함께 간다면 ⟪k:3⟫거절할 이유가 없지.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫바로 가 보자."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0439C8F3_C6DE_422D_BA4F_F3A310E5967F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc401c83f3dd610c4acb21e638dd65cb8939b98ab41fb90303de0456af3b60ca
#. default-sha256: 25f293f50385ff087355af08b4e99c62a3657b15709916f767f3066b1cc9c663
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0439C8F3_C6DE_422D_BA4F_F3A310E5967F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Whoa, whoa, slow down there.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you saying you wouldn’t go if it was just me?"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It’s Michelle or nothing?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫어, ⟪k:2⟫잠깐만, ⟪k:3⟫그 말은 미셸이 없음 거절했단 뜻이야?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫나 혼자면 안 돼?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8DF16205_0566_4025_B2D9_528D1AA14340
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a09c18e37d02bbc1a10a533765c5ff32cd76a82cf9f3ab65caaa918f1b607c37
#. default-sha256: ed927a4e346ecc7ac12f9dfab0dac2cc8b203e067262aebdca9525519427eeec
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8DF16205_0566_4025_B2D9_528D1AA14340"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Of course. Why on earth would I want to go horse-riding alone with you? ⟪k:2⟫I would "
"rather drown myself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫당연하잖냐, ⟪k:2⟫왜 내가 너와 둘이서 산책을 나가야 해. ⟪k:3⟫죽어도 사절할란다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D6BBF839_251E_423D_AD38_1E3477201973
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c53ea0098de82f22c99108d88cbe44a7bfcf8b6299dfb4e7cf00c96f8396fe0
#. default-sha256: 141c092c9420a5d34692471bc166c35b256a0f61db9e31dde9e84e4f942fea41
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D6BBF839_251E_423D_AD38_1E3477201973"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫LE GAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAASP!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫버어어어어어어어어어어엉……!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F4B2BA61_62B5_4150_BFC7_104328D10817
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5f79f5ef83f9a8a279ae1b7d8bc6ffe72ca081500fb7448431540252ce0e222
#. default-sha256: 91b0aacf57b8417da6b46d350f3ed15d2c49f2aba0f95de0780f1f71dbe8232d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F4B2BA61_62B5_4150_BFC7_104328D10817"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Um, Didier... ⟪k:4⟫could I, perhaps, make a small request?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저기…… 디디에 형님. ⟪k:4⟫부탁을 하나 ⟪k:5⟫드리고 싶은데요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D5201F50_0026_463D_ACA6_0B41AE96A802
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f9c07ebb2a77fdbb59c9da4075353e57fd3eec4914f660bb78302d56114ce4c
#. default-sha256: a8848900ff7794fd680bf14aee4b280633c6e23286486d90340540277ac25193
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D5201F50_0026_463D_ACA6_0B41AE96A802"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Go on, let’s hear it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫음, ⟪k:2⟫뭐냐? ⟪k:3⟫말해 봐라."

#: scenario7:scenario7_50A8EFA1_E5B5_46CF_BAFF_2E5A5D2666AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fee95ea2bc369d103c987b43b804049c50dcc5cc08139b5fffd47e8143c9049
#. default-sha256: 7b5036590fbe9b46b78b4ef4b0cef18c1afe8046e6fd62496d40a46c8b104e0f
