#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9c6fd5ad5f4bd21627086ebe48ad92bae700059f5a449e319bc6ca5cf90b1a6
#. default-sha256: 78c5e318d58ae7082832557743831c7cb0f549e6e1d910b5fe24bbdc4b8f4c47
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C4CCB993_E392_47CE_BD12_27757F605AD5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Once she was gone, the servants took over attending to me again.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was still "
"imprisoned, but now there was a serenity in my solitude."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내 수발은 다시 고용인이 들기 시작하여, ⟪k:1⟫유폐 생활은 여전할지언정 ⟪k:2⟫기존하곤 다른 평온"
"이 찾아왔다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_143A5063_370B_441D_A34E_AF8B980D5E77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab33ec98257b2fd9961b78df5061a236c4987201571fa30ed50800bb16eae462
#. default-sha256: c99699eb7a633123db9db8dee1093c552a095d8b47769c4f363edecf88f247c2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_143A5063_370B_441D_A34E_AF8B980D5E77"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I didn’t speak with anyone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t make eye contact.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I didn’t do "
"anything.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I just lived."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫누구하고도 대화하지 않고――, ⟪k:1⟫눈도 안 맞추는 삶. ⟪k:2⟫아무것도 않고 ⟪k:3⟫살기만 ⟪k:4⟫하는 "
"나날."

#: scenario7:scenario7_72AEAE42_49F1_4364_B7CA_B26030FEAEFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 39dc7eb166308ccfe465fa6daf2eeab2aab7491c869dfd3fadfcb7c6aaaf74ec
#. default-sha256: ac68b32bb2227f46ffaabe7b2ff2a0b0ec66e1ce963a126f3aa96b168f2edfca
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_72AEAE42_49F1_4364_B7CA_B26030FEAEFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But even though I had peace, I still feared Aimee having a change of heart. ⟪k:1⟫I trembled "
"at the possibility that one day it might be ⟪k:2⟫her⟪k:3⟫ that opened the door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 나는 평온을 얻고도 ⟪k:1⟫에이미의 변심을 두려워했다. ⟪k:2⟫에이미가 ⟪k:3⟫다시 문을 열 가"
"능성을 생각하면 ⟪k:4⟫온몸이 와들거렸다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_66D50F4F_4564_4159_9ED0_8DCE33771C7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac5592a39af81621a5d0cc6e7d6dae9d7885a822a89d92069c27e2818766acfc
#. default-sha256: da74846211ad51d52585539bdd0a84783bbe77e663612913b23fc29befd0f78e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_66D50F4F_4564_4159_9ED0_8DCE33771C7F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But above all, I hated—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫despised⟪k:4⟫ the fact that I lived in such fear of a "
"girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫무엇보다―― ⟪k:1⟫여자 하나에게 이토록 겁먹는 나 자신이 ⟪k:2⟫죽도록, ⟪k:3⟫미치도록 ⟪k:4⟫싫었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5745DC79_A4B2_4BED_9E68_BF89B16E3BFC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73017cdf2d22cd9ce88f98c7977130077a48756863b80c8c028f68e54c01cbc3
#. default-sha256: 92908beb04f9c7ec601eb2401e7dfbbb65f9dba043e97a691285c07efc53fd03
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5745DC79_A4B2_4BED_9E68_BF89B16E3BFC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫An overwhelming self-loathing threatened to crush me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫강렬한 자기혐오가 ⟪k:1⟫나를 짓누르려 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_38041E82_A7E1_42F4_A06F_AD874E5D500D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8babaefb8500d3eb49e554d073c06251441963bf824b256e6663b812676c99cb
#. default-sha256: 3196168e664df7153782257e6f179353d4894d9e61cb1382b7ba901b3a04233f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_38041E82_A7E1_42F4_A06F_AD874E5D500D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had recurring nightmares about the things Aimee had done to me. ⟪k:1⟫The wounds she gave "
"me did not heal; ⟪k:2⟫they only grew worse, eating away at me day after day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫에이미의 행위는 ⟪k:1⟫수도 없이 ⟪k:2⟫악몽으로 되살아났다. ⟪k:3⟫마음의 상처는 ⟪k:4⟫쉽게 낫지 않"
"았고, ⟪k:5⟫이 생활도 나를 좀먹기만 했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B30C54BC_A771_43D3_BFAB_BBE646C28E91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20064500c4b9832f6675d6dc97605a6335a166123ac12b45725a80af4e08f938
#. default-sha256: 27ea37c80ccd865699b1c74adee203ba347bef6a5e120dd3c62ef1fe4c08c4fe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B30C54BC_A771_43D3_BFAB_BBE646C28E91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was beginning to lose confidence in my own sanity in the silent darkness, where there was "
"no sense of time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫해가 떴는지도 파악이 안 되는 어둠 속에서―― 내가 이성을 유지하고 있는지도 ⟪k:1⟫알 수 없어졌다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6885AAFE_84AF_42AF_91FC_F656B94846F8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 20b05b207ec2cef23d74a2faf4af1392a05d429e467e7a20570cff4d4ea22cfc
#. default-sha256: 9c39a463a50a2e1c45f6650acbaddc94d5ca867fcb6fc03b164770e68ff3c1e3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6885AAFE_84AF_42AF_91FC_F656B94846F8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The line between dream and reality blurred.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I often found myself screaming, crying "
"into the empty air."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫악몽과 현실의 경계가 모호해져―― ⟪k:1⟫홀로 비명을 지르며 ⟪k:2⟫울부짖는 경우도 ⟪k:3⟫잦았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AA286DFC_CE4B_4E3E_986B_240800BF4FEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e3fe1548f089b4f17de21105396fac7da04567e1d61a83070b781dcb39d937c3
#. default-sha256: f88fcd9906e64a9991441253e628c60f029363911990c4371ac5e6596e0f210c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AA286DFC_CE4B_4E3E_986B_240800BF4FEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I clawed at my skin. Pulled out my hair. Paced back and forth across the room. Pounded at "
"the door, yelling for help."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫피부를 마구 긁고, ⟪k:1⟫머리카락을 쥐어뜯고, ⟪k:2⟫불안하게 같은 곳을 빙빙 돌고, ⟪k:3⟫구원을 바"
"라며 벽과 문을 두들기다가――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_6999A1C8_7815_4679_9DB7_59ACA4299776
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 741d830474c36a00fbd03ac68e3fb941d8fbb5e742fef23db5f881ad7e10be13
#. default-sha256: 3e9202170a279679c23b51102281fdaf75d230bb94be330a4a659c23647892b6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6999A1C8_7815_4679_9DB7_59ACA4299776"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Screamed some more."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫절규를 터트리는 걸 ⟪k:1⟫반복했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_771E490D_02E1_49C6_8BF1_E8C383DF1858
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6a660c1f2c8187316632cfd4964236b1c92461540e1765966cf0dc979c299b7
#. default-sha256: 81b8220e618cfb31c24758a36e502cf60224a8730bb44b8357f012c1ae39fd52
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_771E490D_02E1_49C6_8BF1_E8C383DF1858"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was the very image of pitiful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건 지독히 한심하며………"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AEE1FA1B_A986_4635_8CD3_A9866142011B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d641080be474cde2903e1f7bef5a5cf198db2c00f1d9f1058ed49bb5022b9d5
#. default-sha256: fd5029bc1bc413717a3fd69f3b225fc0fcaf71711853e48970b6f1ac7ce78e3a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AEE1FA1B_A986_4635_8CD3_A9866142011B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Absolute wretchedness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫지독히 ⟪k:1⟫비참한 ⟪k:2⟫꼴이었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EE2D0E3_BE2A_4F6A_BF2B_63B905D1F7AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed4816d75f83d3a1078f15a3474ccf1aed1cfa64974503f1ab52233ec1e4388b
#. default-sha256: dc8d7904ff8d8c34e3f32d2a4e9526776556067d756ec806bfb3362d675f8e5d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2EE2D0E3_BE2A_4F6A_BF2B_63B905D1F7AA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And every time I did, I’m sure there was someone on the other side of that door, whispering "
"about how poor Michelle had lost her mind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아마 문 너머 세계에선 ⟪k:1⟫내가 그럴 때마다, ⟪k:2⟫나를 미쳤다고 숙덕거렸으리라……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9B05760C_001D_41C1_AC26_F7FA5F9EBA2B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17c6e76ff9d5ae2ab6767614987328c52faddcf8d984e02ffef575de2b6835c2
#. default-sha256: f107f531ff5d0840facc37f54007a627e5b365d9059dfac52721f1c6d3c6dd2f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9B05760C_001D_41C1_AC26_F7FA5F9EBA2B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Eventually..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그러면서 시간이 갈수록――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_080797CE_CCAE_4D3F_986F_ADF0C94FC215
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5c07f06ca293f34d1d71e7ab3435cec41cdacdd90934623b00d54e1f73eec53
#. default-sha256: 6abbfcf2f5ef6d0f4c40a17a8027bd7f61e24c57070ff81fa64e85ffb1e3a210
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_080797CE_CCAE_4D3F_986F_ADF0C94FC215"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I gave up entirely."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 하나둘씩, ⟪k:1⟫끝내 모든 걸 포기했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9BDF0F1B_2356_4FC0_91E3_69F3E825B893
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 910e19bf37afa45ede1f73eb13a6d89a1023d84b79bc5beb07ee850b21a9f82d
#. default-sha256: 956cb1c4a091466fba769196a180b62bbcd5c808e2374001ce2bb64348710858
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9BDF0F1B_2356_4FC0_91E3_69F3E825B893"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It was a stormy night in my sixteenth year. I had been confined for "
"more than two years at that point."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫……그러다 2년 후, ⟪k:6⟫열여섯 살이 된 ⟪k:7⟫천둥과 비가 쏟아지는 날 "
"밤."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FE2852C9_6404_492F_9DAD_A7BD9AD46F5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a43ebb903fd6168788c2e47e77dc9f200c3b71f6d448f4b1a80895ffa360c2a3
#. default-sha256: e65570e943debc482989a53cc323f7c7966010e842812fefc8466451e748c1a3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FE2852C9_6404_492F_9DAD_A7BD9AD46F5B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Heavy rain pounded against the windows like thousands of little spears."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫창문을 두드리는 빗발은 ⟪k:1⟫창놀림처럼 예리하여 ⟪k:2⟫저택에 후두둑 소리를 냈다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_82D364DC_A28D_4574_B89E_DA4218B2F4B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d4e55706ee35872e47bec15fb99aba1d917b432aa779fcfd9773a52cff93026
#. default-sha256: 68457d1993d7855ba895f3525a2f578cfd1347f9ccc325118a1d0cebf2737e82
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_82D364DC_A28D_4574_B89E_DA4218B2F4B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was sitting quietly on my bed, unable to fall asleep,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어둠 속에서 ⟪k:1⟫잠도 못 들고 침대에 앉아 있자――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7391F8E9_C7B8_4994_BB40_16210B92C3C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d5a9784ec1f812eef391be2f332368177fd92d7c7d2e7f3c6fd341db19ca208
#. default-sha256: caff2437104e68a6c63e58badcda90b557c7013a2d2b60e6376cd5cdade97a2f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7391F8E9_C7B8_4994_BB40_16210B92C3C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫when suddenly, there was a loud banging on the door."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫갑자기 ⟪k:1⟫노크 소리가 들렸다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8C7B1F57_0766_4B09_A315_289A44665437
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c9e1184c7d348152563852041fbd445a08769b07a2f0c4a7d8e35bb875ec904
