msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DD9E9B27_5FA3_474F_83BD_2B242C9AC627"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you aren’t, then hurry up and ⟪k:1⟫get⟪k:2⟫ awake!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫We’ve got big trouble!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자는 중이면 빨랑 일어나! ⟪k:1⟫진짜 중요한 문제야!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_931B90A8_7F36_426E_8A22_5EE2C7BAC3B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53062483e561c85b607a50120f24fdbdc317bd13bcf1b41a67ce06e565ef0ae0
